5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We need a system that actually lasts the whole year. To make it sustainable, we should be realistic about the time and effort required. Let's look into the data before we decide.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree! It's been feeling a bit off lately, hasn't it? I want to make sure the workload is actually fair for everyone, regardless of how much time we spend at home.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. If we want to avoid friction, we need a system that feels fair to everyone. It's better to be thorough now than to have resentment build up over the next few months.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I agree! But it's not just about the work, right? We should also figure out the money part. I don't want anyone to feel sad because they spent too much on sponges or bags!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. I just want to know that the rooms will be clean every time I go in. It's hard when it's unpredictable. I think we should check the details first.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Since we're looking for data, I'll check the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm. I want to know the actual hours involved versus professional options.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use! I really want to see who's actually here and using the space before we set the rules.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into what each housemate counts as done and the rows recorded in the house chat. I think understanding our different standards and past conflicts will help us avoid future arguments.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll check the bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts, plus the management office rate sheet and billing! I want to see exactly how much we're spending on supplies and what the building costs are.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... look into the bathroom grout after the July scrub and the note left by the previous tenants. I want to see if there's a way to keep things consistently clean.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That covers the main bases. By comparing the actual time spent with the cost of a professional service, we can determine if outsourcing is a logical trade-off for our schedules.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"Exactly! And by seeing who's actually around, we can make sure the person who's always home isn't doing all the work for someone who's barely here. That's the only way it'll stay fair!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"It's also important to remember that ""fairness"" is often subjective. By looking at our past disagreements and different definitions of ""clean,"" we can find a middle ground that prevents small annoyances from becoming larger conflicts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"And we can't forget the money! If we just guess, someone always ends up paying more. I want to make sure we have a clear plan for the costs so everyone is happy!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I hope that by looking at the previous tenants' notes and the grout, we can find a standard that works. I just want to stop worrying about what I'll find when I open the door.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. Let's proceed with these investigations. Once we have the facts regarding time, cost, and usage, we can evaluate our options rationally and choose the most sustainable arrangement.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm so excited to see what we find! Let's get to it and make sure we build a system that makes everyone feel happy and balanced. I can't wait to hear what you all discover!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I'm glad we're on the same page. Let's be mindful of how we share this information so we can move forward constructively. I look forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's go on a treasure hunt for the truth! I'll find all the receipts and the bills so we can be super fair with our pennies. See you all soon!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... do my best to find the information. I hope we can find a way to make everything consistent. I'll see you all later.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
